@startuml 使用案例1_3_動物詳情檢視
title 使用案例1.3: 動物詳情檢視

actor "所有使用者" as User
participant "AnimalDetail.vue" as DetailPage
participant "animals.ts" as AnimalAPI
participant "medicalRecords.ts" as MedicalAPI
participant "animals.py(blueprint)" as AnimalBlueprint
participant "medical_records.py(blueprint)" as MedicalBlueprint
participant "animal_service.py" as AnimalService
participant "medical_record_service.py" as MedicalService
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "medical_record.py(model)" as MedicalRecordModel
participant "others.py(Attachment)(model)" as AttachmentModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
participant "shelter.py(model)" as ShelterModel
database "MySQL" as DB

== 1. 進入詳情頁面 ==
User -> DetailPage: 從列表點擊動物卡片\nrouter.push(/animals/:id)
activate DetailPage
DetailPage -> DetailPage: onMounted()\n取得路由參數 animal_id
DetailPage -> DetailPage: 呼叫 loadAnimal()
note right
  loadAnimal() 內部串行執行:
  1. await getAnimal(id)
  2. await loadMedicalRecords(id)
  3. await loadSourceInfo()
end note

== 2. 載入動物完整資料 ==
DetailPage -> AnimalAPI: getAnimal(animal_id)
activate AnimalAPI
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: GET /animals/:id
activate AnimalBlueprint

AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: get_animal(animal_id)
activate AnimalService

AnimalService -> AnimalModel: Animal.query.filter_by(\nanimal_id=:id, deleted_at=None).first()
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id = :id\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: 動物基本資料
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: Animal 物件
deactivate AnimalModel

AnimalService -> AnimalService: animal.to_dict(\ninclude_relations=True)
note right
  include_relations=True 觸發
  SQLAlchemy relationship 載入:
  - images (Attachment)
  - owner (User)
  - shelter (Shelter)
end note

AnimalService -> AttachmentModel: 載入關聯圖片 (relationship)
activate AttachmentModel
AttachmentModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM attachments\nWHERE owner_type = 'animal'\nAND owner_id = :id\nORDER BY display_order
activate DB
DB --> AttachmentModel: 圖片集
deactivate DB
AttachmentModel --> AnimalService: images[]
deactivate AttachmentModel

alt 個人送養 (owner_id 存在)
    AnimalService -> UserModel: 載入送養者 (relationship)
    activate UserModel
    UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_id = :owner_id
    activate DB
    DB --> UserModel: 一般會員資料\n(name, phone, region)
    deactivate DB
    UserModel --> AnimalService: owner
    deactivate UserModel
else 收容所送養 (shelter_id 存在)
    AnimalService -> ShelterModel: 載入收容所 (relationship)
    activate ShelterModel
    ShelterModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM shelters\nWHERE shelter_id = :shelter_id
    activate DB
    DB --> ShelterModel: 收容所資料\n(name, address, contact)
    deactivate DB
    ShelterModel --> AnimalService: shelter
    deactivate ShelterModel
end

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 組裝完整資料
AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: 動物詳細資料 + 圖片 + 送養者
deactivate AnimalService

AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: 200 OK\n{animal, images[], shelter/owner}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> DetailPage: 動物完整資料
deactivate AnimalAPI

DetailPage -> DetailPage: loadSourceInfo()\n檢查關聯資料
note right
  前端優先處理邏輯:
  1. 若 animal.shelter 已存在 → 直接使用
  2. 若 animal.owner 已存在 → 直接使用
  3. 若僅有 shelter_id/owner_id → 額外發起 API 請求
  
  這樣可避免重複查詢
end note

== 3. 載入醫療紀錄 (在 loadAnimal 內) ==
DetailPage -> MedicalAPI: getMedicalRecords(animal_id)
activate MedicalAPI
note right
  API 路徑:
  GET /medical-records/animals/:id/medical-records
end note
MedicalAPI -> MedicalBlueprint: GET /medical-records/animals/:id/medical-records
activate MedicalBlueprint

MedicalBlueprint -> MedicalService: list_animal_medical_records(animal_id)
activate MedicalService

MedicalService -> AnimalModel: Animal.query.filter_by(\nanimal_id=:id, deleted_at=None).first()
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id = :id\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
note right
  檢查動物是否存在
  若不存在則拋出 NotFoundError
end note
DB --> AnimalModel: 動物記錄 (驗證存在)
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> MedicalService: Animal 物件
deactivate AnimalModel

MedicalService -> MedicalRecordModel: MedicalRecord.query.filter_by(\nanimal_id=:id, deleted_at=None)\n.order_by(date.desc()).all()
activate MedicalRecordModel
MedicalRecordModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM medical_records\nWHERE animal_id = :id\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nORDER BY date DESC
activate DB
note right
  ⚠️ 回傳**所有**醫療紀錄 (包含未驗證):
  - 疫苗接種記錄 (VACCINE)
  - 健康檢查記錄 (CHECKUP)
  - 絕育手術記錄 (SURGERY)
  - 治療記錄 (TREATMENT)
  - 其他 (OTHER)
  
  前端顯示邏輯:
  - 顯示所有記錄 (已驗證 ✓ / 未驗證 ⚠)
  - 預設顯示前3筆
  - 可展開查看全部
  
  注意: 與 usecase 1.3 規格不符
  (規格要求僅顯示已驗證記錄)
end note
DB --> MedicalRecordModel: 醫療紀錄列表
deactivate DB
MedicalRecordModel --> MedicalService: List[MedicalRecord]
deactivate MedicalRecordModel

MedicalService --> MedicalBlueprint: 紀錄列表
deactivate MedicalService
MedicalBlueprint --> MedicalAPI: 200 OK {total, medical_records[]}
deactivate MedicalBlueprint
MedicalAPI --> DetailPage: 醫療紀錄列表
deactivate MedicalAPI

== 4. 渲染頁面 ==
DetailPage -> DetailPage: 渲染動物資訊
DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示圖片輪播/畫廊
DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示基本資料\n(名稱、物種、性別、年齡等)
DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示描述與特徵
DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示送養者聯絡資訊
DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示醫療紀錄摘要

== 5. 判斷顯示選項 ==
alt 動物已領養
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示「已領養」標籤
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 隱藏「提出申請」按鈕
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示已領養狀態
else 動物可領養 && 使用者已登入
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示「提出申請」按鈕
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示可申請狀態
else 動物可領養 && 使用者未登入
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示「請先登入」提示
    DetailPage --> User: 提示需登入
end

alt 送養者是當前使用者
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示管理選項
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示「編輯」「下架」按鈕
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示管理介面
end
deactivate DetailPage

== 6. 替代流程 - 圖片燈箱 ==
opt 使用者點選圖片
    User -> DetailPage: 點擊圖片
    activate DetailPage
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 開啟圖片燈箱檢視器
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示大圖 + 左右切換
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示圖片燈箱
    User -> DetailPage: 關閉燈箱
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 關閉燈箱
    deactivate DetailPage
end

== 7. 替代流程 - 查看完整醫療紀錄 ==
opt 使用者查看完整醫療紀錄
    User -> DetailPage: 點擊「展開」查看更多
    activate DetailPage
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: showAllMedicalRecords = true
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示所有醫療紀錄\n(而非只顯示前3筆)
    DetailPage --> User: 顯示完整醫療紀錄列表
    deactivate DetailPage
end

== 8. 替代流程 - 聯絡送養者 ==
opt 使用者聯絡送養者
    User -> DetailPage: 點擊「聯絡送養者」
    activate DetailPage
    alt 使用者已登入
        DetailPage -> DetailPage: 顯示完整聯絡資訊\n(電話、email、地址)
        DetailPage --> User: 顯示聯絡方式
    else 使用者未登入
        DetailPage --> User: 提示「請先登入」
    end
    deactivate DetailPage
end

== 9. 替代流程 - 提出領養申請 ==
opt 使用者提出申請
    User -> DetailPage: 點擊「提出申請」按鈕
    activate DetailPage
    DetailPage -> DetailPage: 導航到申請表單\nrouter.push(/applications/new?animal=:id)
    DetailPage --> User: 前往申請頁面
    note right
      進入使用案例 1.4
      領養申請提交
    end note
    deactivate DetailPage
end

note over User, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 顯示完整動物資訊(基本資料、圖片、描述)
  2. 顯示送養者公開資訊(收容所或個人)
  3. 顯示所有醫療紀錄(包含已驗證與未驗證，預設前3筆，可展開)
  4. 根據狀態顯示對應操作按鈕
  
  **權限控制:**
  - 訪客: 基本資訊 + 公開聯絡方式
  - 會員: 完整資訊 + 申請功能
  - 送養者: 管理功能(編輯、下架)
  
  **狀態判斷:**
  - 已領養(ADOPTED): 不顯示申請按鈕
  - 可領養(PUBLISHED): 顯示申請按鈕(需登入)
  - 自己的送養: 顯示管理選項
  
  **資料載入:**
  - 動物基本資料從 animals API
  - 醫療紀錄從 medical-records API
  - 圖片與關聯資料一併載入
end note

@enduml
